{"skill":{"slug":"liang-tavily-search","displayName":"Tavily Search"},"version":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1772418920934,"changelog":"- Initial release of Tavily Search skill.\n- Enables web search through Tavily’s API, optimized for LLMs.\n- Supports result snippets, scores, metadata, and domain/topic filtering.\n- Provides flexible search depth options and time range filtering.\n- Authentication via environment variable or config file.\n- Includes command-line usage examples and documentation.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2718,"sha256":"66c9539968a23300fb4f9591914b9f5a2df61cd665d036ddb9d69af16aeeeb12","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/search.mjs","size":3992,"sha256":"7bba79629e3af4dd17fbc11ec8c487ad4d25591a8bea6f90b8388ad33625bd1c","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1896,"sha256":"a98339b6815c6f9aac00c91ddf7fff424fc11740f82251bfe6cd1c49be66d87a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789095929844,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"09a00b5c7e1212aa65aeb1e0bd9611cdae7443304e6109fb5992ff72d9738502","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/09a00b5c7e1212aa65aeb1e0bd9611cdae7443304e6109fb5992ff72d9738502","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085606064},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":29,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1789095929844},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward Tavily web-search wrapper that sends user-provided searches to Tavily and does not show hidden persistence, privilege escalation, or unrelated data access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Outbound network access and use of the Tavily API key are proportionate to web search, but users should understand that their search queries and chosen options are sent to Tavily.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill requires Node and a TAVILY_API_KEY supplied by OpenClaw config or environment variable, which is expected for this API-backed search tool.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Instructions are limited to authentication, command examples, and documented CLI options; there are no prompt overrides, hidden agent directives, or automatic actions beyond user-invoked searches.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No file writes, scheduled tasks, background workers, tool wrapping, shell execution, or persistent system changes were found in the artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is web search through Tavily, and the implementation matches that purpose by posting the requested query and selected search options to Tavily's search API and printing returned results.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending search terms and selected search options to Tavily. Avoid using confidential prompts, secrets, personal data, or proprietary internal identifiers as search queries unless Tavily's data handling terms meet your needs.","findings":"[LP3] expected: The artifact declares Node and TAVILY_API_KEY in metadata and uses them for the documented Tavily search integration; lack of richer permission metadata is a packaging transparency note, not evidence of hidden or excessive behavior.\n[SQP-2] expected: The documentation could state privacy implications more explicitly, especially for sensitive queries and --raw-content, but the skill clearly presents itself as using Tavily's API and requires a Tavily API key.\n[E1] expected: The external POST to https://api.tavily.com/search is the core search function, sends the user query and selected search parameters, and does not include unrelated local files or credentials beyond the required authorization token.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789095929844}}}}}